IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-CADE-IMF-NATO-SLOT.

DATA DIVISION.
01 D0-SUBSTRATE-TRUNK.
   05 D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME     PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
   05 D0-K-EXPONENT        PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
   05 D0-MAX-OFFSET-MS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 D1-TACTICAL-TIMING.
   05 D1-SLOT-SELECTOR     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.
   05 D1-OFFSET-MS         PIC 9(9) USAGE R4.
   05 D1-UP-RAMP-MS        PIC 9(9) USAGE R5.
   05 D1-DOWN-RAMP-MS      PIC 9(9) USAGE R6.
01 D2-TIMING-ENVELOPE.
   05 D2-ENVELOPE-Q16      PIC 9(9) USAGE R7.
   05 D2-G-SWIGLU-GATE     PIC 9(9) USAGE R8.
   05 D2-SHADOW-OFFSET     PIC 9(9) USAGE R9.
   05 D2-COMMITTED-STATE   PIC 9(9) USAGE R10.
01 D3-LEAF-EVAL.
   05 D3-PROOF-RULING      PIC 9(9) USAGE R11.
   05 D3-DISP-WRAP-MOD     PIC 9(9) USAGE R12.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE 953467954 TO D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME.
    MOVE 3 TO D0-K-EXPONENT.
    MOVE 12 TO D0-MAX-OFFSET-MS.
    MOVE 1 TO D1-SLOT-SELECTOR.
    MOVE 6 TO D1-OFFSET-MS.
    MOVE 5 TO D1-UP-RAMP-MS.
    MOVE 10 TO D1-DOWN-RAMP-MS.

    PERFORM STAGE-TIMING-ENVELOPE.
    PERFORM EVALUATE-COMMIT.
    PERFORM SYNC-DISPLACEMENT.

    IF D2-SHADOW-OFFSET == D1-OFFSET-MS AND D1-OFFSET-MS <= D0-MAX-OFFSET-MS
        MOVE 0 TO D3-PROOF-RULING
        SET depth 4
    ELSE
        MOVE 5 TO D3-PROOF-RULING
        SET depth 1
    END-IF.

    EVAL.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

STAGE-TIMING-ENVELOPE.
    MOVE D1-OFFSET-MS TO D2-SHADOW-OFFSET.
    COMPUTE D2-ENVELOPE-Q16 = ((D1-UP-RAMP-MS + D1-DOWN-RAMP-MS) * 65536) / (D1-OFFSET-MS + 1).
    COMPUTE D2-G-SWIGLU-GATE = 875 + ((125 * (D1-SLOT-SELECTOR + 1)) / 3).
    EXIT.

EVALUATE-COMMIT.
    COMPUTE D2-COMMITTED-STATE = (((D2-ENVELOPE-Q16 + 43605) * D2-G-SWIGLU-GATE) / 1000).
    EXIT.

SYNC-DISPLACEMENT.
    COMPUTE D3-DISP-WRAP-MOD = D2-COMMITTED-STATE - ((D2-COMMITTED-STATE / 256) * 256).
    EXIT.

END-STRATEGY.
